# Generated test fixture, not a deployed contract. `npm run compact` regenerates it
# from gen-lineage.mjs; verify-max-7.mjs grinds a slot collision against it, which
# costs 27 million hashes at the production depth and a few hundred at depth 8.
# Tracked it would put 620 lines of generated output into every review.
contract/src/lineage-shallow.compact
